{
  "name": "Vehicle Manual Scraper",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Vehicle Manual Scraper (2000-2026)\n\n• **Generate Make/Year** – loops through supported brands and year ranges.\n• **Search DezosManuals** – queries catalog/index pages for manuals.\n• **Extract PDF Links** – filters links that match the target brand/year ranges.\n• **Download Manual** – fetches each PDF while skipping broken links.\n• **Upload File** – sends valid manuals to cloud storage.\n\nRun via the **Manual Trigger** to begin collection. Adjust the Function nodes if you need more brands/years.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520
      },
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -912,
        -736
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Tips & Tweaks\n\n1. **Missing manuals?** The search page might not list every file. Try widening the regex filter in *Extract PDF From Page*.\n2. **Slow site?** Batch the requests with *SplitInBatches* or add a Delay node.\n3. **Storage location** – replace the upload node with your own Google Drive, S3, or other storage.\n4. **Automation** – swap Manual Trigger with Cron for scheduled updates.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "name": "Troubleshooting",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -688,
        -1056
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
